{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-12","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接等边三角形边长平方是半径平方的三倍","englishTitle":"If an equilateral triangle be inscribed in a circle, the square on the side of the triangle is triple of the square on the radius of the circle.","book":13,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","contentId":"euclid-13-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc59ceba2c7d62c5e233d379dbfb70ce6566b527ed679b8e360e3b233d384c1e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-12.statement","euclid-13-12.construction.1","euclid-13-12.construction.2","euclid-13-12.proof.1","euclid-13-12.proof.2","euclid-13-12.proof.3","euclid-13-12.proof.4","euclid-13-12.proof.5","euclid-13-12.proof.6","euclid-13-12.conclusion","euclid-13-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a1f16747489fffbb356607b0ddc739681ac8a9f0cb0573edf914c89372cf134","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an equilateral triangle be inscribed in a circle, the square on the side of the triangle is triple of the square on the radius of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将一个等边三角形刻在圆内,则三角形侧的正方形是圆半径的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2abe0bf3c4800e722e15a03d916a9759123962e39fb65eb345f6a831354ee55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a circle, and let the equilateral triangle ABC be inscribed in it; I say that the square on one side of the triangle ABC is triple of the square on the radius of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC圆圈,让等边三角形个ABC在其中登记;我说,三角ABC的一侧的正方形个圆圈是圆圈半径的正方形个的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55831747f9e51ede2e7f721942e6ba9f5df2bf0f127ff1cf9f4e9f7666648e76","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centre D of the circle ABC be taken, let AD be joined and carried through to E, and let BE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将ABC圈中的D中心连接起来,将AD连接起来,传送到E,将BE连接起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25fafcf93ccb972cbcc751637d5c50178215c6f4339b5e2e0f1a9ab3749bf01e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the triangle ABC is equilateral, therefore the circumference BEC is a third part of the circumference of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABC是等边的 所以环形BEC是环形ABC的第三部分"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b5391c419cb94d517456677f7a7395216c4d97fdea9a73ff4421728ae9a9e1e","citations":["euclid-4-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circumference BE is a sixth part of the circumference of the circle; therefore the straight line BE belongs to a hexagon; therefore it is equal to the radius DE. [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,环形BE是圆环形的第六部分;因此,直线BE属于六边形;因此,它等于半径DE。 [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d716634651fbc043ba1cfdbaf7f1c11f53584d011c7713b25a76ed355aa4bfb3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is double of DE, the square on AE is quadruple of the square on ED, that is, of the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是DE的两倍 AE是正方形的三倍 ED,也就是正方形的三倍（相关点与线段：BE）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"902bc853645ecdf3e4cb0ca085c7e9644e2199a970c970811ba57f673e757aee","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AE is equal to the squares on AB, BE; [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31), [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the squares on AB, BE are quadruple of the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是AE的正方形等于AB,BE的正方形,因此,AB,BE的正方形是正方形的三倍。 [ [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee97b87b074019488ce409f4c7f5831ff42d29651f0ecbb9300903924490f6e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, separando, the square on AB is triple of the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,塞帕兰多,正方形对AB是正方形对BE的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b97a14c55ab6d5ced422c28b0157ecdd920a1e38f6820512c416f251c36f2d72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BE is equal to DE; therefore the square on AB is triple of the square on DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BE等于DE,因此AB的正方形是DE的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83278e13eba9f263e6e007a012b02687add5bd2bf16445bb89ef1ca977958014","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on the side of the triangle is triple of the square on the radius. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此三角形边的正方形是半径正方形的三倍 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-12.source","contentId":"euclid-13-12","revisionId":"euclid-13-12@raw-cc59ceba2c7d62c5","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52f76ce818f44cdb2efe780d232def3ef79d46272eb373390941974bf463c72c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-12:euclid-4-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-12.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"IV. 15, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-12:euclid-3-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-12.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"III. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-12:euclid-1-47:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-12.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-47","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.12","sourceUrl"